expect \[zpwg9\] block powergrid:circuit_board registered=true item=true blockEntity=true
expect \[zpwg9\] items p9a=19/19$
expect \[zpwg9\] items of P9b to P9d registered=circuit_design_table,circuit_schematic \(expect none\)
expect \[zpwg9\] components 28: barretter_tube bjt_npn bjt_pnp button capacitor connector current_gauge diode display_module fuse_holder inductor label light_bulb neon_bulb pentode potentiometer redstone_relay regulator_tube relay relay_dpdt resistor switch thyratron triode varistor vfet via voltage_gauge$
expect \[zpwg9\] component_items 28: .*via->create:copper_nugget \[#forge:nuggets/copper\]
expect \[zpwg9\] component_items item lookup mismatches=0$
expect \[zpwg9\] tag powergrid:circuit_component size=28$
