expect \[zpwg9b\] items of P9c and P9d registered= \(expect none\)
expect \[zpwg9b\] packets \d+:UPDATE_COMPONENT \d+:COMPONENT_ITEMS \d+:CHANGE_SCREEN \d+:SAVE_SCHEMATIC$
count \[zpwg9b\] menus circuit_design_table=true == 2
expect file/pwgponder
count Loaded 28 component items == 1
reject Failed to parse component item
reject InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|Critical injection failure|Mixin apply failed
reject StackOverflowError
reject \[zpwg\w*\] (error|unknown subcommand)
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look ns entity_type as on -12 (record); both packets lines: ordinals consecutive (CHANGE_SCREEN = COMPONENT_ITEMS + 1, SAVE_SCHEMATIC + 2); shell 1: one `Loaded 28 component items` at boot, no mixin error, circuit_design lines are no errors; shell 2: a second `Loaded 28` after the reload; zpwg9b check identical after the reload

